  lineId: guide_3_physics
  speakerOverride: 
  text: 'P-Type Doping adds a Group III Acceptor (3 valence e-: B, Al, Ga, In), creating 1 incomplete covalent bond (hole h+). Neighboring valence electrons hop the OPPOSITE way to fill the vacancy, leaving a fixed teal - ion and shifting EF DOWN toward Ev!'
